{"ref": "Megillah 17b:8", "heRef": "מגילה י״ז ב:ח׳", "sectionRef": "Megillah 17b", "indexTitle": "Megillah", "heIndexTitle": "מגילה", "categories": ["Talmud", "Bavli", "Seder Moed"], "next": "Megillah 18a", "sectionNames": ["Daf", "Line"], "versions": [{"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Daf Shevui", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "http://learn.conservativeyeshiva.org/daf-shevui/", "text": "The Amidah prayer: From where do we know this? — As it has been taught: Shimon Hapakuli organized eighteen blessings in the presence of Rabban Gamaliel in a fixed order in Yavneh. R. Yohanan said (others report, it was stated in a baraita): A hundred and twenty elders, among whom were many prophets, drew up eighteen blessings in a fixed order."}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Talmud Bavli", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%93_%D7%91%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99", "text": "תפלה מנא לן דתניא שמעון הפקולי הסדיר שמונה עשרה ברכות לפני רבן גמליאל על הסדר ביבנה אמר רבי יוחנן ואמרי לה במתניתא תנא מאה ועשרים זקנים ובהם כמה נביאים תיקנו שמונה עשרה ברכות על הסדר"}], "available_versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "http://sefaria.org"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - English", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "https://korenpub.com/collections/the-noe-edition-koren-talmud-bavli-1"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Daf Shevui", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "http://learn.conservativeyeshiva.org/daf-shevui/"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle":